{
\Large
Operators and Decorators Notes
}
\end{center}

\begin{note}
This quiz covers the basics for ``making your own types'' in python.
These techniques are used in standard data science libraries like \lstinline{pandas}, \lstinline{torch}, and \lstinline{sqlalchemy} for making complicated data operations easy for the user.
This quiz focuses on the fundamental techniques,
and later we will learn how they apply concretely to these libraries.
\end{note}
